  m_text: "CARD RITUALS\r\n\r\n1     \u2192  H   Hands on the table\r\n10   \u2192 
    S   Salute\r\n11   \u2192  Q   Hello Sir\r\n12   \u2192  W   Hello Madam\r\n\r\nAll
    players share the same keys.\r\nFastest correct reaction wins the round.\r\n\r\nWrong
    ritual or slowest reaction\r\nreceives a penalty card.\r\n\r\nFirst player to
    reach 5 penalties loses.\r\n"
